  addresses:
    11 14:00 This is the Captain. We're in it. Expect flickers, and no calls home for a while. The bow lounge and rec deck are closed. Look after each other. I'll say more at four. Marrow out.
    13 10:00 This is the Captain. The storm has passed. It wasn't smooth, but we came through it together. Thank you. Comms are back and the booths are open. And there's a party in the bow lounge at 19:00. Marrow out.
